Name "Mek_Factory"

--注: 适用于ATM9 Mekanism工厂自动化

--命名规则:
--机器类: 
--Energy_Src: 终极能量立方
--Metallurgic_Infuser: 冶金灌注机系列(终极)
--Crusher: 粉碎机系列(终极)
--Enricher: 富集机系列(终极)
--Oxidizer: 作为提取灌注化学品的冶金灌注机

--与Metallurgic_Infuser共存的四类标签
--Carbon: 碳注入的冶金灌注机
--Redstone: 红石注入的冶金灌注机
--Diamond: 钻石注入的冶金灌注机
--Obsidian: 强化黑曜石注入的冶金灌注机

--容器类: 
--Ingredient_Infuser: 冶金灌注机原料输入
--Ingredient_Infuser_Extra: 冶金灌注机原料输入(仅作用于富集铁的铁锭输入，是为了避免与铁锭的红石灌注原料碰撞导致无法区分)
--Ingredient_Crusher: 粉碎机原料输入
--Ingredient_Enricher: 富集机原料输入
--Ingredient_Oxidizer: 作为提取灌注化学品的冶金灌注机原料输入
--ME_Face: ME接口保留解释(0-3作为冶金灌注机四种化学品的保留位置，用于供给对应的冶金灌注机使用)
--               (4-8(ME接口)/4-35(ME超大接口)作为产物输出位置)
--Infusion_Dst: 灌注化学品生产的冶金灌注机的化学品输出位置(例如终极化学品储罐)

--能量输送
Every 1 tick do

    Input FE:: From Energy_Src Top Side
        Output FE:: To Each Metallurgic_Infuser Bottom Side
        Output FE:: To Each Crusher Bottom Side
        Output FE:: To Each Enricher Bottom Side
        Output FE:: To Each Oxidizer Bottom Side

End

--灌注工厂
Every 20 ticks do

    --Carbon
    Input minecraft:iron_ingot From Ingredient_Infuser_Extra Top Side
        Output retain 18 Each minecraft:iron_ingot to Each Carbon Bottom Side
    forget

    Input mekanism:enriched_iron From Ingredient_Infuser Top Side
        Output retain 18 Each mekanism:enriched_iron to Each Carbon Bottom Side
    forget

    --Redstone
    Input alltheores:osmium_ingot or minecraft:iron_ingot From Ingredient_Infuser Top Side
        Output retain 18 Each alltheores:osmium_ingot or minecraft:iron_ingot to Each Redstone Bottom Side
    forget

    --Diamond
    Input gtceu:obsidian_dust or mekanism:alloy_infused From Ingredient_Infuser Top Side
        Output retain 18 Each gtceu:obsidian_dust or mekanism:alloy_infused to Each Diamond Bottom Side
    forget

    --Obsidian
    Input mekanism:alloy_reinforced From Ingredient_Infuser Top Side
        Output retain 18 Each mekanism:alloy_reinforced to Each Obsidian Bottom Side
    forget

    --产物输出
    Input From Each Metallurgic_Infuser Top Side Slots 0-8
        Output To ME_Face Bottom Side Slots 4-35
    forget

End

--灌注工厂化学品注入
Every 20 ticks do

    Input infusion:mekanism:carbon From ME_Face Top Side Slots 0
        Output infusion:mekanism:carbon To Each Carbon Bottom Side
    forget

    Input infusion:mekanism:redstone From ME_Face Top Side Slots 1
        Output infusion:mekanism:redstone To Each Redstone Bottom Side
    forget

    Input infusion:mekanism:diamond From ME_Face Top Side Slots 2
        Output infusion:mekanism:diamond To Each Diamond Bottom Side
    forget

    Input infusion:mekanism:refined_obsidian From ME_Face Top Side Slots 3
        Output infusion:mekanism:refined_obsidian To Each Obsidian Bottom Side
    forget

End

--灌注化学品生产
Every 20 ticks do

    Input From Ingredient_Oxidizer Top Side
        Output retain 18 Each to Each Oxidizer Bottom Side
    forget

    Input infusion:mekanism:* From Each Oxidizer Top Side Slots 0
        Output infusion:mekanism:* To Infusion_Dst Top Side
    forget

End

--富集工厂
Every 20 ticks do

    Input From Ingredient_Enricher Top Side
        Output retain 18 Each to Each Enricher Bottom Side
    forget

    --产物输出
    Input From Each Enricher Top Side Slots 0-8
        Output To ME_Face Bottom Side Slots 4-35
    forget

End

--粉碎工厂
Every 20 ticks do

    Input From Ingredient_Crusher Top Side
        Output retain 18 Each to Each Crusher Bottom Side
    forget

    --产物输出
    Input From Each Crusher Top Side Slots 0-8
        Output To ME_Face Bottom Side Slots 4-35
    forget

End